<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean oil major sales activity in the week ended Oct 3 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p> Net Sales:   1996/97		    1997/98</p>
<p> Mexico	  11,000			  Nil</p>
<p> Unknown	  1,400</p>
<p>A total of 9,200 tonnes were outstanding on Sept 30, and carried over into the 96/97 period. There were no shipments for Sept 27-30.</p>
<p>Final accumulated exports of 257,400 tonnes were 73 percent below the 94/95 total of 944,600.</p>
<p>Exports for Oct 1-3 week of 1,000 tonnes were all to Jamaica.</p>
</text>
